WEBVTT

00:06.130 --> 00:08.330
<i>So much has happened.</i>

00:19.240 --> 00:23.470
<i>Every day was new and different.</i>

00:22.250 --> 00:25.000
<b>The Journey Begins</b>

00:24.010 --> 00:26.760
<i>I won't pretend I remember all of it.</i>

00:29.250 --> 00:30.240
<b>Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony</b>

00:29.550 --> 00:33.070
<i>Most of the memories have
 faded and vanished,</i>

00:30.360 --> 00:32.490
<b>Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony</b>

00:32.570 --> 00:34.740
<b>Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony</b>

00:33.930 --> 00:36.760
<i>but many are just as vivid 
as the day they happened.</i>

00:34.860 --> 00:36.740
<b>Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony</b>

00:40.760 --> 00:42.940
<i>I'm sure they're...</i>

02:17.600 --> 02:18.750
Kyoto!

02:18.750 --> 02:19.740
Fall leaves!

02:19.740 --> 02:21.900
Temples!

02:21.900 --> 02:23.210
Yeah.

02:23.210 --> 02:25.490
Yuki sure is excited.

02:28.500 --> 02:29.770
Look at all the trees—

02:29.770 --> 02:31.630
Yoshikawa, cool your jets.

02:31.630 --> 02:33.120
Toru, don't boss me around!

02:33.120 --> 02:33.710
Ow!

02:33.710 --> 02:34.880
Like a parent and child...

02:34.880 --> 02:38.200
It's Yuki's first time in Kyoto, 
so she's raring to go.

02:38.200 --> 02:40.630
I got to come here in middle school.

02:41.360 --> 02:42.890
It's always Kyoto, isn't it?

02:42.890 --> 02:44.650
My school trip was here, too.

02:44.650 --> 02:48.880
But now that we're high schoolers, we get to 
explore more on our own, which is great.

02:48.880 --> 02:50.390
Yeah.

02:50.810 --> 02:52.650
Except at night...

02:52.900 --> 02:54.930
That's right, Miyamura...

02:54.930 --> 02:56.400
How are you going to bathe?

02:57.970 --> 02:59.980
I don't think I can.

02:59.980 --> 03:03.110
I'm prepared to go without 
for the whole trip.

03:03.110 --> 03:05.220
The girls have baths in their rooms,

03:05.220 --> 03:07.340
but the guys have to use the public one.

03:07.340 --> 03:08.890
Also, what about changing clothes?

03:09.220 --> 03:10.790
I'll change in the bathroom.

03:11.280 --> 03:12.700
I see.

03:12.700 --> 03:13.890
Good luck.

03:14.540 --> 03:17.810
<i>Am I even going to enjoy this trip?</i>

03:17.810 --> 03:20.420
<i>Is he even going to enjoy this trip?</i>

03:20.420 --> 03:21.990
There you are!

03:21.990 --> 03:23.840
Took you guys long enough!

03:23.840 --> 03:24.920
Hey, Shu.

03:24.920 --> 03:25.990
Yo!

03:25.990 --> 03:27.370
No one else is here, though.

03:27.370 --> 03:28.300
Not a soul.

03:28.300 --> 03:30.010
I bet your yelling scared them off.

03:30.010 --> 03:31.410
What was that?!

03:31.410 --> 03:32.450
Check this out!

03:32.450 --> 03:34.960
Souvenirs from the shop up ahead!

03:35.560 --> 03:37.570
They looked too good to pass up!

03:37.570 --> 03:39.240
<i>He bought souvenirs on the first day?!</i>

03:39.240 --> 03:43.920
Shu, what are you doing loading up when 
we haven't even been to the hotel yet?

03:44.950 --> 03:46.120
That's a good point!

03:46.120 --> 03:47.150
Wanna eat 'em, then?

03:47.150 --> 03:48.730
Want some, Miyamura?

03:48.730 --> 03:50.600
Huh? Um, I...

03:50.600 --> 03:53.310
I can't believe he bought 
souvenirs on the first day.

03:53.310 --> 03:55.710
<i>Where'd all her excitement go?</i>

03:55.710 --> 03:59.120
Oh, are you and Iura-kun in the same room?

03:55.710 --> 04:01.470
<b>Laugh      Laugh</b>

03:59.120 --> 04:02.390
Yeah, but Ishikawa-kun's with us, too.

04:02.170 --> 04:02.510
<b>Flash</b>

04:04.120 --> 04:05.820
I hope things work out...

04:05.820 --> 04:07.720
<i>I have a feeling they won't.</i>

04:10.140 --> 04:16.480
<b>Class Trip</b>

04:16.480 --> 04:19.100
The bed's so soft!

04:19.100 --> 04:22.240
This room is even better than I expected!

04:22.240 --> 04:25.920
They said we're free until dinner,

04:25.920 --> 04:27.750
but there's nothing to do.

04:27.750 --> 04:29.160
Yeah.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.470
Want to hit up another room?

04:30.470 --> 04:32.490
Oh, like the boys' rooms?

04:32.490 --> 04:34.020
There you go again!

04:36.500 --> 04:39.240
Who picked up the key?

04:39.240 --> 04:40.520
Shu. Shu has it.

04:40.520 --> 04:41.730
Where the hell is he?

04:42.210 --> 04:43.670
What are you guys doing?

04:44.760 --> 04:47.340
Hey, Mizouchi, do you know where Shu is?

04:47.340 --> 04:48.810
He's got our room key.

04:48.810 --> 04:49.760
Iura?

04:49.760 --> 04:52.290
I saw him walk into the room a minute ago.

04:52.890 --> 04:54.860
Shu, you jerk! Open the door!

04:54.860 --> 04:57.150
Ishikawa-kun, calm down!

04:57.660 --> 05:02.150
C'mon, like I said... I'm sorry...

05:03.180 --> 05:06.080
At least let us in the room 
before you take a nap, dumbass!

05:07.010 --> 05:09.080
Anyway, now that our stuff's in the room,

05:09.080 --> 05:10.910
we can relax until dinnertime.

05:11.300 --> 05:13.620
Yeah, guess you're right.

05:13.620 --> 05:15.730
How long do we have?

05:15.730 --> 05:17.880
Hang on. I'll check—

05:17.420 --> 05:20.670
<u><b>Day 1</b></u>
18:00-\h\h\h\h\hPublic bath (Boys only)
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h18:00- Class 1, Groups 1-4
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h18:30- Class 1, Group 5 & Class 2, Groups 1-2
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h30-minute bath time
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hClass 2, Groups 3 and up will bathe at 20:00 after dinner.

05:17.880 --> 05:19.900
Shu, wake up!

05:19.900 --> 05:20.920
Sure...

05:20.670 --> 05:23.170
Class 1, Group 1

05:20.920 --> 05:23.120
Maybe I'll take a nap, too.

05:23.120 --> 05:26.680
Wait, don't we need to bathe before dinner?

05:24.170 --> 05:26.680
<b>Public bath (Boys only)
18:00- Class 1, Groups 1-4</b>

05:26.680 --> 05:27.920
Do we?

05:27.920 --> 05:29.040
<i>Oh crap.</i>

05:29.040 --> 05:30.730
Miyamura, bath time!

05:30.180 --> 05:32.180
<b>Men</b>

05:30.180 --> 05:32.180
<b>Bath</b>

05:30.730 --> 05:32.180
N-No!

05:32.180 --> 05:35.520
What are you talking about? Let's go already!

05:35.520 --> 05:36.730
I... I, uh...

05:36.730 --> 05:38.340
I'll bathe later.

05:38.340 --> 05:40.440
Hey, hurry it up, group 1!

05:40.790 --> 05:42.190
We're all waiting!

05:42.190 --> 05:44.790
<i>H-Help me, Ishikawa-kun...</i>

05:50.880 --> 05:53.410
Miyamura, you're not feeling well, right?

05:53.410 --> 05:55.810
You're not feeling well? Do you have a fever?

05:55.810 --> 05:56.590
Is it a cold?

05:56.590 --> 05:59.040
N-No, i-it's not a cold...

05:59.040 --> 06:02.800
<b>Going for broke</b>

05:59.410 --> 06:02.780
Shu, Miyamura's on his period.

06:05.540 --> 06:06.480
Huh?

06:06.480 --> 06:09.800
I-I-Is that right...?

06:09.800 --> 06:12.810
<b>Going for broke</b>

06:11.580 --> 06:12.810
Yeah.

06:13.120 --> 06:15.030
Hey, what's taking so long?

06:15.030 --> 06:16.270
Get in the bath already!

06:16.270 --> 06:17.060
Shut up!

06:17.060 --> 06:19.840
We're having an existential crisis here!

06:19.840 --> 06:21.080
Huh?!

06:21.080 --> 06:23.990
Miyamura, I did good, right?

06:23.990 --> 06:25.110
Yeah, good job.

06:25.110 --> 06:26.860
And goodbye.

06:30.860 --> 06:31.570
Huh?

06:32.200 --> 06:33.560
Hey, Miyamura.

06:34.230 --> 06:35.450
Hori-san...

06:35.450 --> 06:37.240
I'm apparently on my period.

06:37.240 --> 06:40.080
Says the guy who got
a perfect score in phys ed?!

06:41.430 --> 06:46.170
Wait, is that your excuse to get
out of a bath? That's hilarious!

06:47.040 --> 06:48.700
So how are you gonna bathe today?

06:49.140 --> 06:52.180
My period's giving me cramps,
so I'll go without.

06:52.180 --> 06:54.600
Want to use the shower in our room?

06:55.260 --> 06:58.350
Yuki went to visit a friend
and won't be back for a while.

07:00.270 --> 07:03.490
Won't we get in trouble for a guy 
going into a girl's room?

07:03.490 --> 07:06.990
Er, you don't have to if you don't want to.

07:11.710 --> 07:13.220
I'm alive again...

07:13.220 --> 07:15.630
C'mon, you coulda used the hair dryer.

07:15.630 --> 07:19.210
Well, I'm sure I could have, 
but I didn't want to take too long.

07:22.180 --> 07:23.680
Any word from Yoshikawa-san?

07:23.680 --> 07:24.740
Not yet.

07:24.740 --> 07:25.580
Okay.

07:26.880 --> 07:29.920
I should get my stuff ready for tomorrow.

07:30.510 --> 07:31.710
Hori-san...

07:31.710 --> 07:35.890
Would you let just any guy into your 
room if they were in a tight spot?

07:39.140 --> 07:40.390
You really shouldn't.

07:40.390 --> 07:42.140
Of course I wouldn't.

07:42.810 --> 07:43.680
Really?

07:43.680 --> 07:44.820
Really.

07:45.900 --> 07:47.620
But you let me in.

07:47.620 --> 07:48.900
Well, you're...

07:48.900 --> 07:50.500
Not like that, right?

07:50.500 --> 07:53.100
You're... fine, okay?

07:53.100 --> 07:54.030
Since you're...

07:54.030 --> 07:55.050
I'm what?

07:59.000 --> 08:00.160
I'm what?

08:01.160 --> 08:06.170
Y-You wouldn't t-try anything, right?

08:07.060 --> 08:08.170
Are you sure?

08:11.130 --> 08:13.680
Well, I'll head on back to my room.

08:13.680 --> 08:15.420
Thanks for letting me use your shower.

08:16.200 --> 08:17.800
Hey, wait—

08:19.910 --> 08:23.060
<i>Even if I said he </i>could<i> try something,
 he wouldn't, right?</i>

08:25.900 --> 08:29.810
<i>What was that about letting 
other guys into my room?</i>

08:31.080 --> 08:32.820
I took her towel with me...

08:33.820 --> 08:34.820
Oh, Miyamura.

08:34.820 --> 08:37.070
Hey, Miyamura, gonna put on a yukata?

08:37.070 --> 08:38.450
Did you go somewhere?

08:38.800 --> 08:42.140
Oh, yeah. Sorta.

08:45.720 --> 08:48.110
Whoa, look! There are maiko here!

08:48.110 --> 08:49.340
Don't point!

08:49.960 --> 08:52.330
Whoa! Hey there, ladies!

08:52.330 --> 08:53.720
Don't wave at them!

08:53.720 --> 08:57.000
You two have no idea 
how to behave in public!

08:55.170 --> 08:57.000
I'll return your towel later.

08:57.000 --> 08:59.040
It's fine. We have plenty.

08:59.040 --> 09:01.720
More importantly, what about tonight?

09:02.980 --> 09:04.620
The bath.

09:04.620 --> 09:06.630
If you're coming over, I'll handle Yuki.

09:06.940 --> 09:08.980
Oh, don't worry.

09:10.200 --> 09:13.340
I can always take the late bath
for people who miss theirs.

09:12.480 --> 09:15.490
<b>Anyone who misses their designated bath time can bathe after 23:00.</b>

09:13.340 --> 09:15.490
Oh, I see...

09:16.000 --> 09:18.490
I should have read it more carefully.

09:18.490 --> 09:19.240
Sorry.

09:20.730 --> 09:21.670
Don't be.

09:24.550 --> 09:25.960
Thanks for waiting.

09:25.960 --> 09:27.500
It's all yours.

09:27.930 --> 09:28.880
<i>Are you sure?</i>

09:29.930 --> 09:34.030
Now I feel stupid for thinking 
so much about how to respond.

09:34.030 --> 09:35.940
And why the hell didn't you read the rules?!

09:36.330 --> 09:37.550
Hori?

09:37.550 --> 09:39.460
Are you gonna use the bath?

09:39.460 --> 09:42.150
I am! And I'm gonna be in there until 11:00!

09:42.750 --> 09:44.390
You'll be totally wrinkled.

09:46.570 --> 09:49.900
This class trip really flew by.

09:50.200 --> 09:51.760
It sure did.

09:51.760 --> 09:54.460
It won't be easy, but it's time 
to say goodbye to Kyoto.

09:54.460 --> 09:56.540
At least we took lots of pics.

09:56.540 --> 09:58.160
Oh, I've still got space for more!

09:58.160 --> 09:59.530
Hori, gimme a peace sign!

09:59.530 --> 10:00.780
Hey, cut it out!

10:01.280 --> 10:03.790
I'll print some pictures 
and give you a copy.

10:04.280 --> 10:05.580
Thanks.

10:05.580 --> 10:08.710
Counting the ones our teacher 
took, we'll have a ton.

10:12.410 --> 10:14.710
Here's one of Iura messing with Toru.

10:14.710 --> 10:16.810
That was really funny.

10:16.810 --> 10:18.590
Here's you stuffing your face.

10:24.910 --> 10:27.350
I hope we can all come 
back together sometime.

10:27.350 --> 10:28.350
Yeah.

10:29.020 --> 10:30.100
<b>Hee Hee</b>

10:30.450 --> 10:33.310
Hey! It's time to meet up at the buses!

10:33.310 --> 10:34.800
Got it!

10:34.800 --> 10:37.250
Man, I can't believe 
we're going home already.

10:37.250 --> 10:38.610
I'll race you to the bus!

10:38.610 --> 10:40.430
You're on!

10:40.430 --> 10:41.370
Miyamura.

10:44.260 --> 10:46.870
This was a pretty good class trip.

10:51.250 --> 10:52.650
Yeah, it was.

10:53.880 --> 10:56.290
Hurry up, you two!

10:56.290 --> 10:57.650
Yeah, coming!

11:03.440 --> 11:05.390
Miyamura-kun...?

11:07.220 --> 11:09.940
Wow, it is you! You cut your hair!

11:09.940 --> 11:12.100
W-Wait! Turn off the hose first!

11:13.220 --> 11:14.320
Oh, right!

11:14.320 --> 11:15.500
Sorry about that.

11:15.500 --> 11:17.360
You really got soaked.

11:17.900 --> 11:20.360
It's okay. I'll wring out my clothes later.

11:20.360 --> 11:23.030
That won't do!
You need to dry off with a towel.

11:23.030 --> 11:24.470
Let's go to the clinic.

11:25.560 --> 11:26.990
The clinic?

11:27.370 --> 11:28.620
<b>Clinic</b>

11:29.050 --> 11:29.800
Here.

11:30.120 --> 11:31.990
Ah, thanks.

11:32.750 --> 11:35.850
<i>No one's here. Are we allowed 
to just use the towels?</i>

11:36.500 --> 11:38.660
Why not take off your cardigan?

11:41.600 --> 11:43.130
I'll just leave it on.

11:44.890 --> 11:49.200
I've been wondering...
Why do you always stay all covered up?

11:49.200 --> 11:52.830
You didn't even bathe with 
the other guys during the class trip.

11:52.830 --> 11:58.270
All of the boys pick swimming for phys ed,
 but you always pick running.

11:58.270 --> 12:01.650
Th-The council president runs 
during swimming time, too!

12:01.650 --> 12:03.590
Oh, I don't mind Sengoku-kun doing it.

12:03.590 --> 12:04.410
Why not?!

12:04.780 --> 12:07.350
Actually, Sengoku-kun told me 
you always change clothes

12:07.350 --> 12:10.290
in the bathroom or an empty classroom.

12:10.290 --> 12:11.790
<b>Wants to know</b>

12:10.290 --> 12:11.980
So, why is that?

12:11.980 --> 12:14.790
<i>Crap. She's more persistent than I thought.</i>

12:18.420 --> 12:19.550
What?!

12:20.410 --> 12:22.700
I thought you might actually 
be a girl or something.

12:23.230 --> 12:26.300
Do I <i>look</i> like a girl to you?

12:26.770 --> 12:29.710
Ah, so she's suspicious.

12:29.710 --> 12:32.410
I feel like she's gonna find me out.

12:32.410 --> 12:33.840
I'm exhausted.

12:33.840 --> 12:35.380
And hot.

12:35.380 --> 12:36.880
<i>So you </i>do<i> get hot in that.</i>

12:38.200 --> 12:39.570
Y'know, I had a thought.

12:39.570 --> 12:43.570
<b>Something like a vest</b>

12:39.960 --> 12:41.270
Why not wear something like this?

12:41.270 --> 12:42.950
My arms would show.

12:42.950 --> 12:44.070
Ah...

12:44.440 --> 12:46.640
Yet you'll wear a sailor-style uniform.

12:45.070 --> 12:47.320
<b>This is my old middle school uniform.


















Try it on when you have the chance!</b>

12:47.320 --> 12:49.830
<i>I don't want to try it on 
even when I have the chance.</i>

12:50.700 --> 12:53.150
<i>I don't know why Hori-san wants me to.</i>

12:54.330 --> 12:58.190
<i>I'll just put it on and 
tell her it was too small.</i>

12:58.190 --> 12:59.590
<i>There's no way it'll fit.</i>

13:03.100 --> 13:04.840
Oh, Toru-kun.

13:04.840 --> 13:05.850
Come on in.

13:05.850 --> 13:07.470
<i>It fits...</i>

13:05.850 --> 13:07.470
Sorry to barge in like this.

13:07.470 --> 13:08.910
He's in his room.

13:08.910 --> 13:10.350
I'm coming in!

13:10.350 --> 13:12.030
Oh, sorry, Miyamura.

13:12.030 --> 13:13.820
Could you let me look at your textbook?

13:13.820 --> 13:15.510
I forgot mine at school.

13:15.510 --> 13:16.630
Is something wrong?

13:16.630 --> 13:17.600
Hey!

13:16.630 --> 13:17.600
Not now!

13:17.600 --> 13:19.240
Please not now!

13:21.800 --> 13:23.720
I-It's not what you think, Ishikawa-kun!

13:23.720 --> 13:24.650
This is...

13:24.650 --> 13:27.350
Yeah, it looks good.

13:29.910 --> 13:31.720
It wasn't what it looked like!

13:31.720 --> 13:33.790
What, so you won't wear one again?

13:33.790 --> 13:35.590
You should try it.

13:35.590 --> 13:38.420
Ah, but your hair could be...

13:38.880 --> 13:41.360
A little longer. Just a bit.

13:41.360 --> 13:42.520
Shoulder length.

13:42.520 --> 13:44.250
Or just enough to hide your ears.

13:44.250 --> 13:46.400
Can you stop playing mental dress-up with me?

13:46.930 --> 13:47.890
I've got it.

13:47.890 --> 13:49.170
Just grow it out for six months.

13:49.170 --> 13:50.250
Now you're deciding things?!

13:50.250 --> 13:52.680
Why? What's so great about 
sailor-style uniforms?!

13:52.680 --> 13:54.740
You used to hate them!

13:54.740 --> 13:57.230
No, I didn't! I told you last time, but—

13:57.230 --> 13:59.540
Like I remember!

13:59.540 --> 14:01.570
<i>I seem to run into them a lot.</i>

14:01.570 --> 14:02.940
President!

14:01.830 --> 14:02.940
Sengoku!

14:02.230 --> 14:02.690
<b>Shudder</b>

14:03.320 --> 14:04.540
Sailor uniforms or blazers?!

14:04.540 --> 14:05.590
Which is better?!

14:05.590 --> 14:06.410
Huh?!

14:06.410 --> 14:08.950
The sailor style looks great on girls, right?

14:08.950 --> 14:11.310
That silhouette leaves me speechless.

14:11.310 --> 14:13.550
No, it's gotta be a blazer.

14:13.550 --> 14:15.390
They work with neckties or ribbons.

14:15.390 --> 14:16.310
Right, President?

14:16.310 --> 14:19.210
What are you two talking about?

14:19.210 --> 14:21.260
You know! How it gets a man going

14:21.260 --> 14:23.110
when he sees girls in clothes he likes!

14:23.110 --> 14:24.980
Oh, so your preferences?

14:24.980 --> 14:29.060
Yes! Ishikawa-kun says the sailor style 
is better and won't listen.

14:30.200 --> 14:32.220
I actually prefer tracksuits.

14:32.970 --> 14:37.850
<b>S
H
O
C
K</b>

14:33.230 --> 14:34.980
Whoa, is he serious?

14:34.980 --> 14:37.850
What?! Athletic wear is good, right?!

14:38.470 --> 14:40.700
Sengoku, just be honest.

14:40.700 --> 14:42.750
You like the school swimsuits, don't you?

14:42.750 --> 14:44.860
Really, President? That's a bit much!

14:44.860 --> 14:45.980
That's not what I said!

14:45.980 --> 14:47.610
Either that or gym bloomers.

14:47.610 --> 14:48.900
What year do you think it is?!

14:48.900 --> 14:51.030
Then what's in nowadays?

14:51.030 --> 14:53.430
Now it's those... navy socks, right?

14:52.620 --> 14:54.710
<i>Miyamura likes blazers.</i>

14:53.430 --> 14:55.520
Oh, and black knee-highs are good, too.

14:53.910 --> 14:57.000
Acquiring odd intel

14:55.520 --> 14:57.000
Yeah, I get you!

14:59.690 --> 15:01.510
<i>Oh, I don't mind Sengoku-kun doing it.</i>

15:01.510 --> 15:02.510
<i>Why not?!</i>

15:03.270 --> 15:05.720
Sengoku-kun, your shirt 
looks a little baggy.

15:05.720 --> 15:08.010
Does it? I think it's the same as always.

15:08.920 --> 15:11.510
<i>I like his slender body.</i>

15:12.050 --> 15:13.900
<i>He's self-conscious about being too thin</i>

15:13.900 --> 15:16.810
<i>and puts shirts on under his white one.</i>

15:17.230 --> 15:20.270
<i>I know all about it.</i>

15:22.060 --> 15:25.020
No way!

15:23.270 --> 15:25.020
Student Counseling

15:25.430 --> 15:26.650
What's wrong?

15:26.650 --> 15:28.280
Didn't you know?

15:28.280 --> 15:32.650
Swimming is optional, but all the boys 
have to do it on the last day.

15:32.650 --> 15:34.290
N-No one told us!

15:34.290 --> 15:36.180
They changed the rule this year.

15:36.180 --> 15:38.410
You got a notice about it.

15:39.160 --> 15:41.920
And you can't be absent without good reason.

15:42.380 --> 15:43.310
Like a broken leg?

15:43.310 --> 15:44.920
Don't be rash, Miyamura-kun!

15:44.920 --> 15:46.200
This isn't fair!

15:46.200 --> 15:47.550
Why only the boys?

15:47.550 --> 15:49.630
Right?! I couldn't agree more!

15:49.630 --> 15:51.050
We're on different pages!

15:51.870 --> 15:55.560
I'm perpetually amazed that 
they let you be a teacher.

15:55.560 --> 15:57.200
I'm pretty smart, you know.

15:57.200 --> 15:58.630
And I like high school girls.

15:58.630 --> 15:59.750
They should come and arrest you.

15:59.750 --> 16:00.430
Hey now.

16:00.770 --> 16:02.300
Why not just do it?

16:02.300 --> 16:04.440
It's one day in the pool.

16:04.860 --> 16:06.540
Can I keep my clothes on?

16:06.540 --> 16:08.570
I'd like to as well.

16:08.570 --> 16:10.240
Are you trying to drown?

16:10.800 --> 16:12.550
So you don't want to take your clothes off?

16:12.550 --> 16:14.660
My clothes are like skin to me.

16:14.660 --> 16:16.240
A second skin.

16:16.530 --> 16:19.060
Would you have me rip off my own skin

16:19.060 --> 16:22.480
and then sit out in the scorching sun?

16:22.480 --> 16:24.120
Calm down, Sengoku.

16:24.120 --> 16:27.670
Extra! "Cruel School Skins Student!"

16:27.670 --> 16:29.630
Don't go making up headlines.

16:29.630 --> 16:31.790
Four days until pool day...

16:31.790 --> 16:33.890
If only the world would end.

16:33.890 --> 16:36.570
Oh, Sensei, I have an excuse for that day.

16:36.570 --> 16:38.640
What, you're gonna skip?

16:38.640 --> 16:42.440
Four days from now will overlap 
with my 28-day cycle.

16:42.440 --> 16:44.790
I have no idea what you're talking about.

16:44.790 --> 16:46.150
That's no fair, Miyamura-kun!

16:46.150 --> 16:48.450
Sensei, I have the same excuse for that day!

16:48.450 --> 16:49.700
President!

16:49.700 --> 16:52.280
Just cut the crap!

16:52.280 --> 16:55.660
<b>Shutting up</b>

16:52.280 --> 16:55.660
No matter how much you whine, 
you're not getting out of this.

16:57.660 --> 16:59.400
Oh, I see.

16:59.400 --> 17:00.710
That's too bad, I guess.

17:00.710 --> 17:02.410
Wh-What's going on, Miyamura-kun?

17:03.150 --> 17:06.540
Sensei, I don't own a swimsuit.

17:06.540 --> 17:08.500
Well, not to worry.

17:08.500 --> 17:12.300
The school is prepared, 
so they'll let you rent one.

17:12.670 --> 17:14.650
That's great news, Miyamura-kun.

17:14.650 --> 17:15.350
Yeah...

17:15.350 --> 17:18.440
I just don't understand
why there's no pool day for the girls.

17:18.440 --> 17:20.970
Because there are guys like you 
at the school. Get a clue.

17:20.970 --> 17:23.580
I never should've applied to Katagiri High.

17:23.580 --> 17:26.560
But then you never would've met Hori.

17:26.560 --> 17:28.200
Don't sell me short.

17:28.200 --> 17:29.860
I'd have found a way to meet her.

17:29.860 --> 17:30.960
Don't mess with me.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.190
Now you wanna get expelled?

17:32.490 --> 17:35.850
I hope that when I wake up in four days, 
my right arm will have exploded.

17:35.850 --> 17:37.570
Can't you just fake a cold?

17:37.910 --> 17:39.830
Okay, a cold it is.

17:39.830 --> 17:42.170
A cold that will blow up my arm.

17:42.170 --> 17:44.330
What kind of colds do you catch?

17:44.330 --> 17:46.390
You've got it good though, President.

17:46.390 --> 17:48.280
You can at least wear a swimsuit.

17:48.280 --> 17:50.590
What burden do you bear, Miyamura?

17:50.910 --> 17:54.650
What? You embarrassed about 
putting on a swimsuit, Miyamura?

17:55.590 --> 18:00.040
How's getting in the pool
in a swimsuit any better than coming

17:55.590 --> 18:04.350
<b>Serious</b>

18:00.040 --> 18:01.970
to English class in your birthday suit?

18:01.970 --> 18:04.350
You're talking to your English teacher, dolt.

18:04.840 --> 18:08.270
I'd rather be publicly guillotined 
than be seen in a swimsuit.

18:08.270 --> 18:11.860
Why is this a matter
of life or death for you, Sengoku?

18:12.610 --> 18:15.860
Well, I can tell that you guys 
really don't want to get in the pool.

18:16.600 --> 18:19.390
I'll talk to Sasaki-sensei.

18:19.860 --> 18:20.870
What?!

18:20.870 --> 18:22.480
F-F-For real?!

18:22.480 --> 18:24.120
Speak to your elders politely.

18:24.120 --> 18:25.620
Thanks a bunch!

18:25.620 --> 18:27.280
Yeah, that still coulda been better.

18:27.280 --> 18:30.700
Will you really talk to Sasaki-sensei?

18:30.700 --> 18:34.000
I will, but no promises.

18:34.000 --> 18:37.650
It's a teacher's duty to listen
to students' concerns and find solutions!

18:34.090 --> 18:34.960
<b>Intense</b>

18:37.650 --> 18:39.630
Don't put it like that. 
You're making me nervous.

18:40.090 --> 18:42.030
Four days from now,
we will <i>not</i> be undressing!

18:42.030 --> 18:43.510
And you're getting bolder.

18:44.020 --> 18:46.850
You'll both still need a reason.

18:46.850 --> 18:49.840
Miyamura-kun is on his period,
and I'll be in an explosion.

18:49.840 --> 18:50.480
That's all.

18:50.480 --> 18:52.840
Is that really what you want me to say?

18:52.840 --> 18:53.860
No, not really.

18:53.860 --> 18:55.950
We arrived at those through 
extensive compromising.

18:55.950 --> 18:57.860
This is gonna be a pain.

18:58.640 --> 19:02.110
What a big relief, though. 
I wasn't sure what I'd do.

19:02.910 --> 19:03.730
I wanna hit the beach.

19:03.730 --> 19:04.740
Huh?!

19:04.740 --> 19:07.000
Woo-hoo!

19:08.260 --> 19:10.460
Shu, no cannonballs!

19:10.460 --> 19:11.750
The pool is the best!

19:11.750 --> 19:13.670
Aren't you hot, Miyamura-kun?

19:13.670 --> 19:16.080
No, I am, but I'll be fine.

19:16.080 --> 19:17.260
You're making <i>me</i> hot, too!

19:17.600 --> 19:20.120
Get that deck clean, you slackers!

19:20.120 --> 19:21.510
Yes, sir.

19:22.550 --> 19:25.460
Man, my feet are hot.

19:25.460 --> 19:27.150
Don't you have sandals, President?

19:27.150 --> 19:29.270
Remi took them before I got here.

19:29.270 --> 19:31.390
Sengoku, why not come in for a dip?

19:31.390 --> 19:33.010
I would if no one else was around.

19:33.010 --> 19:34.400
You're like one of the girls!

19:35.020 --> 19:37.250
Sengoku-san!

19:37.250 --> 19:38.780
You're asking for it!

19:38.780 --> 19:40.900
Bring it on! Bring it, bring it!

19:42.160 --> 19:43.470
Ow...

19:43.470 --> 19:45.400
We were just clowning around a little..

19:45.400 --> 19:47.340
Quit clowning around and get to work!

19:47.340 --> 19:48.560
You okay?

19:49.230 --> 19:52.420
Are you two shrinking violets doing your job?

19:52.420 --> 19:54.250
Oh, Kyo-chan!

19:54.250 --> 19:55.670
What's with the surprise?

19:55.670 --> 19:56.840
You on your way home?

19:56.840 --> 19:58.430
The girls only had to come for the morning.

19:58.430 --> 19:59.170
See ya!

19:59.170 --> 20:01.390
Hey, Remi, my sandals!

20:01.390 --> 20:02.430
Not a chance!

20:02.830 --> 20:05.360
I'm not giving them back!

20:06.650 --> 20:07.720
Are those sandals cool?

20:07.720 --> 20:09.000
Yep, nice and cool.

20:09.000 --> 20:10.270
I heard girls!

20:10.270 --> 20:11.220
What?!

20:11.220 --> 20:12.800
Ayasaki's feet are exposed!

20:12.800 --> 20:14.900
You're right! They're so cute!

20:15.940 --> 20:18.990
Get back in the water, you pervy kappas!

20:18.990 --> 20:20.190
Sengoku's pissed!

20:20.190 --> 20:21.090
The president is scary!

20:21.090 --> 20:22.320
What are they doing?

20:22.320 --> 20:24.680
I told you to clean!

20:24.680 --> 20:25.950
Yes, sir.

20:28.830 --> 20:31.870
Why clean it when it's not even dirty?

20:31.870 --> 20:33.130
My thoughts exactly.

20:33.130 --> 20:34.210
Hey.

20:34.750 --> 20:36.710
How's it going?

20:36.710 --> 20:37.580
Our messiah.

20:37.580 --> 20:38.660
Our messiah.

20:37.960 --> 20:40.710
Messiah

20:38.660 --> 20:40.710
Don't call me that. You're being pains.

20:41.340 --> 20:43.630
Miyamura, aren't you hot in that?

20:43.630 --> 20:46.100
Yes, of course I am.

20:46.100 --> 20:48.260
Why do you look tired of hearing that?

20:48.260 --> 20:49.960
Why did you come, Sensei?

20:49.960 --> 20:52.390
The girls left, so I got bored.

20:52.390 --> 20:54.060
Now there're only guys around.

20:54.060 --> 20:55.590
Yeah, that's what I figured.

20:55.590 --> 20:57.100
Yasuda-sensei!

20:57.100 --> 20:58.070
It's Terajima-sensei...

20:58.070 --> 21:00.980
I put you in charge of the boys' 
tutoring session, didn't I?!

21:00.980 --> 21:02.720
Are you stupid or something?!

21:02.720 --> 21:05.020
Yeah, I might be.

21:05.020 --> 21:07.530
<i>He just said he was smart four days ago.</i>

21:07.530 --> 21:10.540
Honestly, I don't have time for this!

21:08.850 --> 21:10.540
See ya.

21:10.540 --> 21:13.420
Man, Sengoku, your legs are so thin!

21:15.440 --> 21:16.910
It's not like it's on purpose.

21:16.910 --> 21:18.210
What's your hips measurement?

21:18.210 --> 21:18.910
I don't know.

21:18.910 --> 21:21.480
So, what's the deal, Sengoku? Can't swim?

21:21.480 --> 21:22.400
Don't mess with me.

21:22.400 --> 21:23.920
I'm invincible in the water.

21:24.190 --> 21:28.940
I'm perfectly at home in the water.
It is my domain.

21:28.940 --> 21:30.810
Then what're you doing on land?

21:30.810 --> 21:33.130
I really like swimming, too.

21:33.130 --> 21:35.690
That's rich coming from a guy
who's skipping pool day.

21:35.690 --> 21:38.730
<i>Well, I know Miyamura wants 
to keep his tattoos a secret...</i>

21:38.730 --> 21:42.150
Ow! A cramp! My foot cramped!

21:41.000 --> 21:43.190
Shu, you idiot!

21:43.950 --> 21:47.960
You did that <i>Inugami Clan</i> 
handstand thing, didn't you?

21:47.960 --> 21:50.090
No... but I won't deny it.

21:50.090 --> 21:51.130
Which is it?

21:52.500 --> 21:56.470
Come to think of it, why are Sengoku-san 
and Miyamura excused today?

21:56.470 --> 21:57.710
They seem fine.

21:57.710 --> 22:01.350
Sengoku's arm blew up, 
and Miyamura's on his period.

22:01.350 --> 22:02.930
Oh...

22:03.990 --> 22:04.710
Huh?!

22:05.060 --> 22:09.330
Well, it's summer, so there're 
bound to be a few explosions.

23:36.470 --> 23:39.980
Next time
page.2 Cooking Class
